    <section class="why-section">
      <h2>Why FleetGuide?</h2>
      <p>
        FleetGuide.in helps fleet owners, drivers, and transport managers understand GPS systems, 
        transport rules, and reduce operational cost. Our free calculators and comprehensive guides 
        make fleet management simpler and more efficient for businesses across India.
      </p>
